  "findings": [
    "All eight normal states at 1280/768/320 and all four text-200% states at those widths were inspected. Buttons are substantial green/gold native controls; selected denomination has a solid ring, disabled controls have dashed boundaries and accessible explanations.",
    "A single dock follows visible Hand A/B; cards remain dominant and unobstructed. Betting input, chips and Deal retain the accepted compact region and real exact input.",
    "Insurance choices use a transparent compact decision surface, with distinct Even Money action only when eligible and full explanation discoverable through native disclosure. The existing bright programmatic focus outline is deliberately retained, including on entry into Insurance/result states.",
    "All 23 genuine browser-zoom screenshots were inspected, including five cards, Split, multiple RSA leaves, Dealer hidden/revealed states and betting/Insurance/Even Money/unaffordable controls. Labels remain readable and controls operable by scrolling; no overlap or horizontal overflow was observed.",
    "Focused behavioral and geometric assertions corroborate the visual inspection: native 44px targets, status/keyboard routing, unchanged normal desktop camera footprints, Stand bottom 883.359375px, existing hand-to-controls gaps 6px desktop/16px tablet/10px mobile.",
    "This is the required focused visual gate before full regression, not owner acceptance or a fresh independent review."
